   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>这是完井环节里<strong>标注成本最低</strong>的一类任务：数据主体由机理模型批量生成，真实失效案例（断脱、密封泄漏）数量少、难得，只用来校验模型的危险区判得准不准——千万别拿几口失效井去「训练」，那是把例外当规律。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>管柱结构与材料</span><span class='cl-s'>钢级、壁厚、下深、封隔器参数</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需标注，设计文档直接取</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>工况参数</span><span class='cl-s'>温度、压力、产量变化</span></span><span class='cl-n'>可批量仿真生成训练集</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>失效案例</span><span class='cl-s'>断脱、泄漏记录</span></span><span class='cl-n'>少量真实标签，仅用于校验</span></div></div>"
